y left)) (uuid b0298be6-9bb3-56ca-bed2-65e46c72e503)) (text "470pF is at the RHD pin; 10M bleeds the internal node. Switch capacitance/leakage/injection and shared reference mismatch remain modeled assumptions." (at 101.6 396.875 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid d7144c78-d473-5c8a-99aa-a7c6b2bb5dd3)) (text "Fault threshold follows +/-5V rails and is far outside RHD +/-0.4V linear DC range. External low-voltage qualification is mandatory before unclamping." (at 101.6 404.495 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7961c787-8a3a-5116-88e8-7d324da7cff9)))
